1
00:01:30,410 --> 00:01:34,970
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:37,940
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:57,759 --> 00:02:00,790
We sent her to deliver invitations
for the charity sale.

4
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:02,280
Is there a problem with that?

5
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,610
Just a routine inquiry. Don't be nervous.

6
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:05,400
Take a picture.

7
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,940
[Shanghai Ciji Foundation
Membership Application Form]

8
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:08,419
This is Shen Kexi's file
at the Ciji Foundation.

9
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:12,030
Volunteer Shen
has been here for almost a year.

10
00:02:12,310 --> 00:02:14,170
She mainly works the night shift,

11
00:02:14,270 --> 00:02:16,870
and she only interacts with people
from Ciji Foundation

12
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:18,470
and those receiving relief.

13
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:21,280
Her social life is very simple and clean.

14
00:02:22,150 --> 00:02:24,630
No. 76 must have made a mistake.

15
00:02:24,750 --> 00:02:26,350
Where does she usually live?

16
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,750
We have our own dormitory.

17
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:28,980
Everyone lives together.

18
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,100
Okay, thank you.

19
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,640
Did you take the picture?

20
00:02:35,870 --> 00:02:36,560
I did.

21
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:45,420
This is your first time here, right?

22
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:57,170
Are you thinking about that woman?

23
00:02:57,930 --> 00:02:58,930
Will she die?

24
00:03:04,730 --> 00:03:06,280
You said she's a Communist.

25
00:03:07,170 --> 00:03:07,970
She denied it.

26
00:03:09,210 --> 00:03:11,140
Her feet were nailed to the ground,

27
00:03:11,490 --> 00:03:12,820
and she still denied it.

28
00:03:16,810 --> 00:03:19,140
Communists are pretty much all like that.

29
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:23,760
What do you think...

30
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:26,500
faith is?

31
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:33,380
Probably something worth living for.

32
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:35,710
Do you have it?

33
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:40,480
You definitely don't.

34
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:44,750
I do.

35
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:48,320
Cigarettes, alcohol,

36
00:03:48,590 --> 00:03:49,790
and beautiful women.

37
00:03:54,430 --> 00:03:56,380
Are all the people from No. 76

38
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:58,060
like you,

39
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,010
selfish, hedonistic,

40
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:01,500
and heartless?

41
00:04:03,190 --> 00:04:05,380
Aren't you also working for No. 76?

42
00:04:05,790 --> 00:04:06,940
I'm not like you.

43
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:08,960
How are you different?

44
00:04:10,940 --> 00:04:12,260
You are too cruel.

45
00:04:13,430 --> 00:04:14,430
You're not human.

46
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:19,630
Sometimes what you see
isn't necessarily the truth.

47
00:04:22,550 --> 00:04:24,110
Do you still need the pictures?

48
00:04:24,110 --> 00:04:25,670
They don't prove she's a Communist.

49
00:04:25,670 --> 00:04:27,530
Handing them in would be useless.

50
00:04:34,510 --> 00:04:36,070
Su Causeway has been arrested.

51
00:04:34,659 --> 00:04:35,980
[Yan'an]

52
00:04:36,010 --> 00:04:40,790
[He Yufeng, Chief of the CCP
Enemy Area Work Department]

53
00:04:36,550 --> 00:04:37,990
Requesting rescue.

54
00:04:38,670 --> 00:04:39,550
Diana.

55
00:04:41,900 --> 00:04:42,580
Reply.

56
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:45,030
Awaken Leifeng Pagoda.

57
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:53,050
Taking photos?

58
00:04:53,940 --> 00:04:55,140
I'm Xin Xiang.

59
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:56,650
[Xin Xiang, Photo Studio Apprentice]

60
00:04:55,140 --> 00:04:56,670
I'm the new shop assistant.

61
00:05:03,350 --> 00:05:03,990
Jinbao.

62
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:06,230
Jinbao!

63
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:07,260
What?

64
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:09,220
Who's the guy at the door?

65
00:05:13,230 --> 00:05:14,460
You spend all your time

66
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:15,990
with that female official.

67
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:18,300
If we don't find someone
to watch the shop,

68
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:19,900
it'll close sooner or later.

69
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,360
Where did you find him?

70
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:24,070
Let him learn photography from you.

71
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,540
He's cheap and obedient.

72
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:27,390
Aren't you coming in?

73
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:33,070
This is your master.

74
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,730
Introduce yourself first.

75
00:05:36,350 --> 00:05:37,750
Hello, I'm Xin Xiang.

76
00:05:37,820 --> 00:05:39,750
I worked at Sanchuan Photo Studio before,

77
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:41,020
but my master's skills were poor,

78
00:05:41,020 --> 00:05:42,020
so I jumped ship.

79
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:43,440
I'm not stupid.

80
00:05:43,550 --> 00:05:44,580
In a place like that, even if I worked

81
00:05:44,580 --> 00:05:45,430
until I was 99,

82
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:46,580
I'd never make it.

83
00:05:46,990 --> 00:05:48,790
As if you could live to 99.

84
00:05:50,020 --> 00:05:50,580
Right.

85
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:52,510
Whatever you say is right, Master.

86
00:05:52,670 --> 00:05:53,990
I'm not your master.

87
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:55,350
I'm your boss.

88
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:56,230
Nonsense.

89
00:05:56,610 --> 00:05:57,490
I'm the boss.

90
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:01,500
There's an empty room for you
by the stairs.

91
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:02,690
Go upstairs and get your things together.

92
00:06:02,690 --> 00:06:03,460
Okay, Boss.

93
00:06:21,820 --> 00:06:23,220
Don't smile so creepily.

94
00:06:24,900 --> 00:06:25,990
Boss, come.

95
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,050
Sit, sit.

96
00:06:30,750 --> 00:06:32,210
Can you lend me some money?

97
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:34,190
For what?

98
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:35,310
To save someone.

99
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,060
Who?

100
00:06:38,350 --> 00:06:39,140
My cousin.

101
00:06:39,970 --> 00:06:40,700
Your cousin?

102
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:42,940
How come you suddenly

103
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:44,550
have a cousin in Shanghai?

104
00:06:45,140 --> 00:06:47,020
It's the lady who came here

105
00:06:47,020 --> 00:06:48,150
when we just opened.

106
00:06:48,550 --> 00:06:50,280
You said she looked like a star.

107
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:55,240
She's your cousin?

108
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:57,770
Who are you trying to fool?

109
00:06:58,110 --> 00:07:00,510
She looked familiar
the last time I saw her.

110
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:04,060
We ran into each other again later
and recognized each other.

111
00:07:04,060 --> 00:07:06,670
She was caught by No. 76.

112
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:08,660
They said she's a Communist.

113
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:10,140
So is she?

114
00:07:10,670 --> 00:07:12,260
They pierced her feet,

115
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:13,580
and she still denied it.

116
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:14,630
What do you think?

117
00:07:15,570 --> 00:07:16,400
So cruel?

118
00:07:21,140 --> 00:07:22,270
How much do you want?

119
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:23,380
5,000.

120
00:07:24,190 --> 00:07:24,820
Also,

121
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,110
you know a lot of people.

122
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:30,030
Can you ask around
to see who can get her out?

123
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:32,500
Cang Guanglian from last time
definitely won't do.

124
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:33,630
He's a fraud.

125
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:37,380
How about 10,000?

126
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:39,300
5,000 is indeed a bit too little.

127
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:40,820
Go to sleep.

128
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,940
You can have anything in your dreams.

129
00:07:42,940 --> 00:07:44,700
A life is at stake.
You can't just leave her to die.

130
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:46,500
My cousin is definitely a good person.

131
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:47,360
Let me tell you,

132
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:50,020
I only care about money now, not people.

133
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,380
I just think

134
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:54,750
you're the best person in the world,

135
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:56,080
so I came to you for help.

136
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:57,460
Flattery won't work.

137
00:07:58,430 --> 00:08:01,030
You dare to get involved with anything
related to the Communist Party?

138
00:08:01,030 --> 00:08:03,030
You'll get yourself killed one day.

139
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:04,580
She's your cousin,

140
00:08:04,820 --> 00:08:05,940
not your father.

141
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,650
Anyway, I have to save her.

142
00:08:09,350 --> 00:08:10,380
If you get yourself killed,

143
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:11,900
find a place to bury yourself.

144
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:13,500
I won't collect your corpse.

145
00:08:13,670 --> 00:08:16,400
Didn't you help me
when I was in trouble last time?

146
00:08:17,310 --> 00:08:18,750
You have a mind of your own.

147
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:19,680
I can't stop you.

148
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,550
Think it through yourself.

149
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:23,630
Since No. 76 says she's a Communist,

150
00:08:23,710 --> 00:08:26,970
it's impossible to get her out
just by spending some money.

151
00:09:35,450 --> 00:09:37,690
Everyone went to the ball!

152
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,360
And I had to spend

153
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:42,210
the whole night here because of you!

154
00:09:51,090 --> 00:09:52,210
Kill me.

155
00:09:53,090 --> 00:09:54,020
What did you say?

156
00:09:54,730 --> 00:09:55,970
Kill me.

157
00:09:56,970 --> 00:09:58,040
Kill you?

158
00:09:59,330 --> 00:10:00,570
I won't.

159
00:10:03,090 --> 00:10:04,750
I'll give you one more chance.

160
00:10:05,570 --> 00:10:06,370
Will you talk?

161
00:10:13,210 --> 00:10:14,090
If you're happy,
why don't you have a drink with me?

162
00:10:14,090 --> 00:10:14,880
Alright, stop talking.

163
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:15,690
Dance with me.

164
00:10:15,690 --> 00:10:16,450
Director Li.

165
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,160
Okay.

166
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:39,810
Got a cigarette?

167
00:10:51,410 --> 00:10:53,270
You should be more of a gentleman.

168
00:11:11,330 --> 00:11:12,160
Nice ring.

169
00:11:13,290 --> 00:11:14,420
Where did you buy it?

170
00:11:15,410 --> 00:11:16,940
I had a silversmith make it.

171
00:11:19,370 --> 00:11:21,370
You can't buy such a good ring.

172
00:11:23,530 --> 00:11:24,660
Which silversmith?

173
00:11:28,390 --> 00:11:29,260
The west.

174
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,440
Hello, Leifeng Pagoda.

175
00:11:56,770 --> 00:11:57,890
The Organization has decided

176
00:11:57,890 --> 00:11:59,690
to rescue Shen Kexi at all costs.

177
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:01,560
How?

178
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,800
Aren't we going to dance?

179
00:12:07,970 --> 00:12:09,200
Her feet are nailed to the ground.

180
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,930
How can I be in the mood to dance?

181
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:16,560
Find a way to send her to the hospital.

182
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,760
Inspector Su,

183
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:30,290
I... I want to ask you for a dance.

184
00:12:32,270 --> 00:12:33,600
Do you know how to dance?

185
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,650
You can teach me.

186
00:12:35,790 --> 00:12:38,390
There are plenty of dancers
at Great Shanghai Ballroom.

187
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:40,050
Find them if you want to learn.

188
00:12:42,510 --> 00:12:43,360
Inspector Su,

189
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:46,160
I want to show you something.

190
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,700
I've been to the Ciji Foundation.

191
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:54,180
She really is a volunteer.

192
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:56,250
She's been working there for a while.

193
00:12:56,790 --> 00:12:59,390
It was just her job
to deliver things to Ou Yang.

194
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:00,840
This is the evidence.

195
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:18,760
Didn't you want to ask me for a dance?

196
00:13:32,830 --> 00:13:34,830
What's your relationship with her?

197
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:36,640
No lying.

198
00:13:38,550 --> 00:13:40,550
We knew each other when we were kids.

199
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:41,600
She took

200
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:43,690
some photos at my shop before.

201
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,880
Are you very close?

202
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:47,720
No.

203
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,080
Then why?

204
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,720
Playing the hero saving the beauty?

205
00:13:54,910 --> 00:13:56,150
I'm not a hero.

206
00:13:57,980 --> 00:13:59,980
I'm someone who was wronged by them.

207
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,510
So is she.

208
00:14:03,310 --> 00:14:04,270
I said,

209
00:14:04,910 --> 00:14:05,960
no lying.

210
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:07,910
I'm not lying.

211
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,180
She's a good person, not a Communist.

212
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:15,040
That's a dangerous thing to say.

213
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:16,800
I haven't told anyone else.

214
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,620
Then why did you come to me?

215
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:24,290
I think you're different from the others.

216
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:29,360
You're wrong.

217
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,620
I'm just like Li Moqun.

218
00:14:32,210 --> 00:14:33,870
We both work for the Japanese.

219
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,390
Just like you said,

220
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:36,890
we are traitors.

221
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,360
But she really is a good person.

222
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,390
I have proof.

223
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,150
At No. 76,

224
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,400
proof is the most useless thing.

225
00:14:47,310 --> 00:14:48,640
Don't mention it again.

226
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:52,420
So you're just going to watch
an innocent person

227
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:53,840
be framed?

228
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,120
Watch your mouth.

229
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:58,190
If you don't want it anymore,

230
00:14:58,190 --> 00:14:59,190
just say the word.

231
00:15:02,430 --> 00:15:03,270
Inspector Su,

232
00:15:04,390 --> 00:15:06,360
if this is the kind of person you are,

233
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,360
I don't want to work for you anymore.

234
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:10,470
I'm afraid karma will catch up with me.

235
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:11,470
Stop right there.

236
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,650
Do you know why I'm not helping you?

237
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,680
Because your dancing

238
00:15:22,910 --> 00:15:23,960
is terrible.

239
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,620
Give me back the photo.

240
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,370
I'll burn it for you.

241
00:15:32,270 --> 00:15:33,730
It's dangerous to keep it.

242
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:51,190
I could only hold my camera like an idiot,

243
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:55,730
standing there watching her suffer,

244
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:58,940
unable to do anything.

245
00:16:00,790 --> 00:16:02,430
I told you a long time ago,

246
00:16:03,510 --> 00:16:04,670
in these times,

247
00:16:05,030 --> 00:16:06,880
a camera can't save lives.

248
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,670
At that moment, I wished

249
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,720
I had a gun in my hand.

250
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:19,880
I would point it at
that bastard Cang Guanglian's head

251
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:21,240
and blow his brains out.

252
00:16:26,390 --> 00:16:28,360
You're finally getting it.

253
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,600
I'm telling you,

254
00:16:32,190 --> 00:16:33,790
learn from me,

255
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:36,520
and that day will come sooner or later.

256
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:39,510
Blow his brains out.

257
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,080
Blow his brains out.

258
00:16:56,750 --> 00:16:57,950
But right now,

259
00:16:58,990 --> 00:16:59,990
I'm useless.

260
00:17:01,670 --> 00:17:02,990
I can't save her.

261
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:05,319
It's okay.

262
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:07,390
I'll help you.

263
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:09,640
You?

264
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,190
I am Battalion Commander Du.

265
00:17:15,750 --> 00:17:16,910
Give me a gun,

266
00:17:17,910 --> 00:17:20,770
and those idiots
won't be enough for me to deal with.

267
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:23,800
Brother.

268
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,880
From today on,

269
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:28,710
you are my brother.

270
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,600
Let's charge in together

271
00:17:32,390 --> 00:17:34,750
and put that bastard Cang down, okay?

272
00:17:37,430 --> 00:17:38,750
Blow his brains out!

273
00:17:53,190 --> 00:17:54,640
Be honest with me.

274
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:58,670
Is she really a Communist?

275
00:18:27,150 --> 00:18:27,760
Boss.

276
00:18:28,110 --> 00:18:30,040
No. 76 is too greedy.

277
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:32,080
They extorted 300,000 silver dollars
at once.

278
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:33,080
That's 300,000 silver dollars.

279
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:35,280
I've never seen so much money in my life.

280
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,360
Look.

281
00:18:41,290 --> 00:18:43,520
[Flour King Slams No. 76
for Kidnapping and Extortion]

282
00:18:48,710 --> 00:18:49,910
Where is Chen Kailai?

283
00:18:51,430 --> 00:18:52,520
He drank too much last night.

284
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,250
He's probably still sleeping.

285
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:56,840
Chen Kailai!

286
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:02,840
Chen Kailai!

287
00:19:03,820 --> 00:19:04,690
Get up!

288
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:06,910
Don't bother me.

289
00:19:07,150 --> 00:19:08,600
I'm not going to No. 76.

290
00:19:09,670 --> 00:19:10,520
Look at this.

291
00:19:10,990 --> 00:19:11,880
What?

292
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:14,950
It's not the first time

293
00:19:14,950 --> 00:19:16,190
No. 76 has done this.

294
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,300
But this time, it's become a big deal.

295
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:21,100
People outside are protesting
about your cousin.

296
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:26,200
I knew she was different from others.

297
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:28,460
Who is it?

298
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:30,560
Get out.

299
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:31,370
I need to change.

300
00:19:31,370 --> 00:19:32,360
Where are you going?

301
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:33,730
No. 76. Go out.

302
00:19:33,750 --> 00:19:35,210
No more unjust persecution!

303
00:19:35,210 --> 00:19:37,130
No more unjust persecution!

304
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:38,840
No more kidnapping and brutality!

305
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:40,640
No more kidnapping and brutality!

306
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:42,380
Release the innocent volunteer!

307
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:44,100
Release the innocent volunteer!

308
00:19:44,100 --> 00:19:45,990
No more unjust persecution!

309
00:19:46,010 --> 00:19:47,970
No more unjust persecution!

310
00:19:48,970 --> 00:19:49,890
Idiot!

311
00:19:51,490 --> 00:19:54,090
If you had gotten something
out of her earlier,

312
00:19:54,170 --> 00:19:56,370
would things have turned out like this?

313
00:19:56,800 --> 00:20:00,200
Director, I specifically checked
with the Ciji Foundation.

314
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:02,080
She is indeed a volunteer there.

315
00:20:02,360 --> 00:20:04,600
And it's true
that she was delivering invitations

316
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:05,810
to past donors.

317
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:06,400
Well...

318
00:20:09,170 --> 00:20:10,040
Did we...

319
00:20:10,650 --> 00:20:12,730
catch the wrong person?

320
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:18,450
Did we?

321
00:20:22,690 --> 00:20:23,410
No.

322
00:20:23,970 --> 00:20:25,230
We definitely didn't.

323
00:20:25,250 --> 00:20:26,980
This woman must be a Communist.

324
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:28,000
Why?

325
00:20:28,490 --> 00:20:29,100
Wh-

326
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,250
She's too stubborn.

327
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:38,730
No more unjust persecution!

328
00:20:38,730 --> 00:20:40,600
No more unjust persecution!

329
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:42,280
No more kidnapping and brutality!

330
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:44,210
No more kidnapping and brutality!

331
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:51,910
You need to be more ruthless.

332
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,900
I'm afraid she can't take it.

333
00:20:53,900 --> 00:20:55,430
I can barely take it myself!

334
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,490
Before dark,

335
00:20:57,490 --> 00:20:58,690
no matter what it takes,

336
00:20:58,690 --> 00:21:00,360
you must make her talk!

337
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:01,290
Understood.

338
00:21:05,380 --> 00:21:06,640
Where is Captain Cang?

339
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:08,930
He was called away by Director Li.

340
00:21:08,930 --> 00:21:09,750
Pan-fried buns.

341
00:21:09,750 --> 00:21:10,610
From Dahuchun.

342
00:21:10,840 --> 00:21:12,280
Thank you, Section Chief Zhao.

343
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:13,480
She still won't talk?

344
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:15,200
No, she still won't talk.

345
00:21:22,890 --> 00:21:23,800
Is she awake?

346
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:29,120
I've never seen anyone so stubborn!

347
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:31,250
Why so angry?

348
00:21:31,600 --> 00:21:32,600
Because of her.

349
00:21:33,080 --> 00:21:34,540
I haven't eaten all night.

350
00:21:35,650 --> 00:21:36,280
If she still won't talk,

351
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:38,410
it means your methods aren't working.

352
00:21:40,210 --> 00:21:41,270
To deal with women,

353
00:21:41,490 --> 00:21:43,950
you have to use
both the carrot and the stick.

354
00:21:46,080 --> 00:21:48,010
I just finished appeasing Director Li.

355
00:21:48,010 --> 00:21:49,560
Now I have to coax her?

356
00:21:49,770 --> 00:21:50,830
Am I that pathetic?

357
00:21:51,280 --> 00:21:53,810
I'm worried
you've been hitting her too hard.

358
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,560
Before you can make her talk,

359
00:21:55,560 --> 00:21:56,970
what if she dies?

360
00:21:57,390 --> 00:21:59,250
If she's sent to the hospital
and they can't save her,

361
00:21:59,250 --> 00:22:00,850
who's going to take the fall?

362
00:22:03,210 --> 00:22:04,270
Why don't you do it?

363
00:22:04,650 --> 00:22:06,040
Help me out.

364
00:22:06,530 --> 00:22:07,990
I haven't slept all night.

365
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:10,560
I can't do interrogations.

366
00:22:11,010 --> 00:22:13,450
The Logistics Section only delivers food.

367
00:22:17,730 --> 00:22:19,530
You just know how to mess with me.

368
00:22:22,520 --> 00:22:24,690
You are a hot potato.

369
00:22:26,550 --> 00:22:27,200
Brother,

370
00:22:27,890 --> 00:22:30,020
the Director's throwing another fit.

371
00:22:30,210 --> 00:22:31,560
They're gathering at our door.

372
00:22:31,560 --> 00:22:32,960
How could he not be angry?

373
00:22:37,730 --> 00:22:39,120
You are really tough.

374
00:22:48,360 --> 00:22:49,560
She passed out again.

375
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:52,800
Get some water. Get some water.

376
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:53,650
Wake her up!

377
00:22:56,840 --> 00:22:58,210
It's raining so hard outside.

378
00:22:58,210 --> 00:22:59,470
Did you take a car here?

379
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:01,520
I took the tram.

380
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:03,930
When the driver comes back later,

381
00:23:03,930 --> 00:23:05,320
I'll have him take you home.

382
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:06,520
Please don't bother.

383
00:23:06,760 --> 00:23:08,010
On the way here just now,

384
00:23:08,010 --> 00:23:09,470
I passed by Jing'an Temple

385
00:23:09,520 --> 00:23:11,180
and saw several tailor shops.

386
00:23:11,520 --> 00:23:12,850
I'd like to look around.

387
00:23:13,120 --> 00:23:14,160
Miss Ou Yang,

388
00:23:14,180 --> 00:23:16,240
do you have any tailors to recommend?

389
00:23:16,320 --> 00:23:18,120
It's hard for me to recommend it.

390
00:23:18,520 --> 00:23:20,320
Miss Shen, you're so beautiful.

391
00:23:20,410 --> 00:23:22,070
You'll look good in anything.

392
00:23:24,450 --> 00:23:26,910
From the Ciji Foundation
to Ou Yang's house,

393
00:23:27,010 --> 00:23:28,970
you don't pass by Jing'an Temple at all.

394
00:23:28,970 --> 00:23:31,100
They are in two different directions.

395
00:23:31,250 --> 00:23:32,520
So I think

396
00:23:33,080 --> 00:23:34,410
she was testing the waters,

397
00:23:34,410 --> 00:23:35,280
or rather,

398
00:23:35,650 --> 00:23:36,930
it's a secret signal.

399
00:23:42,840 --> 00:23:45,320
In that case, she really is fishy.

400
00:23:49,760 --> 00:23:51,600
Release the innocent volunteer!

401
00:23:51,600 --> 00:23:53,250
Release the innocent volunteer!

402
00:23:53,250 --> 00:23:55,080
No more unjust persecution!

403
00:23:55,080 --> 00:23:56,930
No more unjust persecution!

404
00:23:56,970 --> 00:23:58,650
No more kidnapping and brutality!

405
00:23:58,650 --> 00:24:00,490
No more kidnapping and brutality!

406
00:24:00,490 --> 00:24:01,930
Release the innocent volunteer!

407
00:24:01,930 --> 00:24:03,210
Release the innocent volunteer!

408
00:24:03,210 --> 00:24:05,210
But if you tell the people down there

409
00:24:05,650 --> 00:24:06,930
that this woman is definitely a Communist

410
00:24:06,930 --> 00:24:08,950
because she passed by Jing'an Temple,

411
00:24:08,950 --> 00:24:10,150
will they believe it?

412
00:24:10,970 --> 00:24:11,840
That's why

413
00:24:11,930 --> 00:24:13,790
we need to secure her confession.

414
00:24:15,320 --> 00:24:17,320
Let me give you an idea, Director Li.

415
00:24:18,320 --> 00:24:19,360
I'm all ears.

416
00:24:21,040 --> 00:24:22,970
Since she is Ou Yang's accomplice,

417
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:26,250
we can bring Ou Yang here to identify her.

418
00:24:26,830 --> 00:24:28,630
Then she won't be able to deny it.

419
00:24:29,320 --> 00:24:32,120
Ou Yang is detained
by the Plum Blossom Agency.

420
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:35,210
We can't get her out.

421
00:24:38,140 --> 00:24:40,340
You can discuss it with General Kagesa.

422
00:24:40,490 --> 00:24:42,280
There's no room for discussion.

423
00:24:42,280 --> 00:24:44,410
I might as well figure out a way myself.

424
00:24:45,320 --> 00:24:46,450
I have to say,

425
00:24:47,080 --> 00:24:48,690
Captain Cang is brave

426
00:24:48,690 --> 00:24:49,730
but lacks wisdom.

427
00:24:50,250 --> 00:24:51,410
Even if he beat her to death,

428
00:24:51,410 --> 00:24:53,250
he might not get anything out of her.

429
00:24:53,250 --> 00:24:54,050
Well...

430
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:54,850
Come in.

431
00:25:00,690 --> 00:25:01,360
Director.

432
00:25:01,960 --> 00:25:04,620
That woman couldn't take it,
and she passed out.

433
00:25:10,450 --> 00:25:11,360
Go wake her up.

434
00:25:11,520 --> 00:25:12,600
We tried everything,

435
00:25:12,600 --> 00:25:14,450
but... but she didn't respond.

436
00:25:17,410 --> 00:25:19,070
Send her to the hospital then.

437
00:25:19,550 --> 00:25:20,770
What are you waiting for?

438
00:25:20,770 --> 00:25:21,760
Listen to Inspector Su

439
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:23,230
and send her to Renji Hospital
immediately.

440
00:25:23,230 --> 00:25:23,880
Yes.

441
00:25:32,560 --> 00:25:33,420
The tea is good.

442
00:25:46,320 --> 00:25:48,250
We should go visit the wounded too.

443
00:26:01,490 --> 00:26:03,420
Didn't you say you weren't coming?

444
00:26:04,170 --> 00:26:05,970
You published the photo, right?

445
00:26:06,600 --> 00:26:07,280
Thank you.

446
00:26:07,600 --> 00:26:09,130
It has nothing to do with me.

447
00:26:10,800 --> 00:26:11,760
From now on,

448
00:26:11,970 --> 00:26:13,570
I'm at your service anytime.

449
00:26:14,600 --> 00:26:15,600
Bring your camera

450
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:16,450
and let's go.

451
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:20,690
Where are you going?

452
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:25,980
This way! This way!

453
00:26:28,320 --> 00:26:29,080
Be careful!

454
00:26:32,170 --> 00:26:33,030
Close the door.

455
00:26:33,850 --> 00:26:34,610
Come on.

456
00:26:35,290 --> 00:26:36,210
Give me a hand. Come on.

457
00:26:36,210 --> 00:26:37,140
Come on. Slowly.

458
00:26:38,520 --> 00:26:39,760
One, two, three!

459
00:26:40,930 --> 00:26:42,390
Pull it out. Open the door.

460
00:26:47,120 --> 00:26:48,380
She can still be saved.

461
00:26:50,450 --> 00:26:51,780
Clean the wounds first.

462
00:27:01,690 --> 00:27:02,750
Get him out of here.

463
00:27:03,040 --> 00:27:03,650
Yes.

464
00:27:04,340 --> 00:27:05,970
Excuse me, please go somewhere else.

465
00:27:05,970 --> 00:27:06,650
You two,

466
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:08,800
guard that entrance.

467
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:09,710
Yes.

468
00:27:12,040 --> 00:27:13,240
Let's go have a smoke.

469
00:27:17,390 --> 00:27:18,450
Keep a close watch.

470
00:27:18,450 --> 00:27:18,970
Yes.

471
00:27:40,670 --> 00:27:42,000
Why is this woman here?

472
00:27:42,510 --> 00:27:46,370
Seems like she's visiting the wounded
from the racecourse shooting.

473
00:27:47,060 --> 00:27:49,460
She never misses a chance
to get attention.

474
00:28:02,190 --> 00:28:03,390
Get ready for action.

475
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:17,610
Got a light?

476
00:28:20,370 --> 00:28:21,430
Here, have a smoke.

477
00:28:31,270 --> 00:28:32,300
No smoking here.

478
00:28:32,330 --> 00:28:34,060
Go outside if you want to smoke.

479
00:28:36,930 --> 00:28:38,260
Let's go smoke. Come on.

480
00:28:48,810 --> 00:28:50,010
Take good care of him.

481
00:28:50,290 --> 00:28:50,920
Thank you.

482
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:51,850
Thank you.

483
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:52,610
Thank you.

484
00:28:56,530 --> 00:28:57,720
Take good care of yourself.

485
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:58,440
Thank you, officer.

486
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:59,120
Thank you.

487
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:06,250
Thank you very much.

488
00:29:06,280 --> 00:29:06,910
Thank you.

489
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,250
I just came to visit you.

490
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:13,920
Thank you.

491
00:29:27,930 --> 00:29:29,810
[Closed]
[Under Maintenance]

492
00:29:31,890 --> 00:29:32,530
Nurse!

493
00:29:32,890 --> 00:29:34,510
Are they trying to save a woman inside?

494
00:29:34,510 --> 00:29:34,900
Yes.

495
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:36,370
In her twenties, with injured feet?

496
00:29:36,370 --> 00:29:37,290
Is she still alive?

497
00:29:37,290 --> 00:29:38,240
If you continue stopping me
from getting medicine,

498
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:39,150
she probably won't survive.

499
00:29:39,150 --> 00:29:40,010
Go. Go quickly.

500
00:29:46,550 --> 00:29:48,030
Doctor, come take a look!

501
00:29:48,050 --> 00:29:48,640
Doctor.

502
00:29:48,670 --> 00:29:49,240
What's wrong?

503
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,290
Take a look quickly, doctor.

504
00:29:50,290 --> 00:29:51,050
Doctor.

505
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:52,190
Come and look.

506
00:29:53,090 --> 00:29:53,700
Look.

507
00:29:54,030 --> 00:29:55,760
Family members, wait outside.

508
00:30:02,330 --> 00:30:03,770
Drive to the back door of the hospital.

509
00:30:03,770 --> 00:30:04,360
Hurry up!

510
00:30:09,540 --> 00:30:10,970
Don't be nervous. Relax.

511
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:12,530
You're about to give birth.

512
00:30:41,900 --> 00:30:43,630
-What happened?
-Where is she?

513
00:30:44,570 --> 00:30:45,300
Where is she?

514
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:47,290
What's going on?

515
00:30:47,290 --> 00:30:48,160
Where did she go?

516
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:48,640
I don't...

517
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:49,370
I don't know.

518
00:30:49,640 --> 00:30:50,370
Where is she?

519
00:30:50,440 --> 00:30:52,100
She was... She was taken away!

520
00:30:52,770 --> 00:30:53,370
Let's go!

521
00:31:40,180 --> 00:31:41,040
What happened?

522
00:31:45,850 --> 00:31:46,980
Who opened the door?

523
00:31:48,160 --> 00:31:49,090
Speak!

524
00:31:56,800 --> 00:31:59,060
What's wrong? She's about to give birth?

525
00:32:10,050 --> 00:32:11,200
Go tell her family

526
00:32:12,090 --> 00:32:13,400
that the pregnant woman
is about to give birth,

527
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:15,860
and that she needs
to go to the delivery room.

528
00:32:18,590 --> 00:32:19,520
Family members?

529
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:20,820
She is about to give birth.

530
00:32:20,820 --> 00:32:21,880
She needs to go to the delivery room.

531
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:23,340
She's about to give birth?

532
00:32:28,700 --> 00:32:29,630
Give me the keys.

533
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:41,010
Nobody move.

534
00:32:42,010 --> 00:32:42,810
Go over there.

535
00:32:54,660 --> 00:32:55,590
What happened?

536
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:56,770
She went missing.

537
00:32:56,770 --> 00:32:58,170
Before our men could act.

538
00:32:58,890 --> 00:32:59,720
Inspector Su,

539
00:33:01,780 --> 00:33:03,040
Your car was hijacked.

540
00:33:04,130 --> 00:33:04,790
Where did it happen?

541
00:33:04,790 --> 00:33:05,720
At the back door.

542
00:33:09,560 --> 00:33:10,840
Captain, it's here.

543
00:33:11,130 --> 00:33:12,370
When we came out chasing them—

544
00:33:12,370 --> 00:33:13,880
it looked like Inspector Su's car

545
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:15,140
on Inspector Su's car.

546
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:22,200
Inspector Su.

547
00:33:22,960 --> 00:33:24,420
I was just looking for you.

548
00:33:24,610 --> 00:33:25,470
Where is my car?

549
00:33:27,080 --> 00:33:29,140
It seems the Communists took her away

550
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,040
using your car

551
00:33:30,810 --> 00:33:31,770
right from here.

552
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:39,060
Are you suspecting me, Captain Cang?

553
00:33:39,190 --> 00:33:40,120
I wouldn't dare.

554
00:33:40,910 --> 00:33:42,500
My driver was taken hostage,

555
00:33:42,500 --> 00:33:44,360
and the Communist was taken away.

556
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,200
All of this

557
00:33:46,030 --> 00:33:47,890
is because of your incompetence.

558
00:33:49,590 --> 00:33:50,990
You'd better think about

559
00:33:51,510 --> 00:33:54,370
how to explain this to Director Li
when you get back.

560
00:34:01,580 --> 00:34:03,040
Do you really suspect her?

561
00:34:06,770 --> 00:34:08,770
Director Li will have the final say.

562
00:34:23,330 --> 00:34:24,730
What did you see just now?

563
00:34:25,770 --> 00:34:27,330
I saw them hijack your car.

564
00:34:28,080 --> 00:34:29,610
How many people were there?

565
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:31,210
Three or four.

566
00:34:35,120 --> 00:34:37,170
This doesn't have anything to do with you,
does it?

567
00:34:37,170 --> 00:34:38,159
How is that possible?

568
00:34:38,159 --> 00:34:39,469
You called me here.

569
00:34:44,719 --> 00:34:45,920
You can go back first.

570
00:34:55,790 --> 00:35:00,830
[Renji Hospital]

571
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:21,440
Besides us,

572
00:35:22,560 --> 00:35:24,690
who else would have saved Su Causeway?

573
00:35:27,650 --> 00:35:28,730
They used your car.

574
00:35:29,600 --> 00:35:31,530
I'm afraid they're coming for you.

575
00:35:32,360 --> 00:35:33,690
No matter who they were,

576
00:35:34,380 --> 00:35:35,670
I hope she's okay.

577
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:38,810
I'm worried about her feet.

578
00:35:41,890 --> 00:35:43,820
Will she ever be able to walk again?

579
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:03,890
Sir, hurry up.

580
00:36:10,170 --> 00:36:10,700
Brother,

581
00:36:10,920 --> 00:36:12,050
we brought her back.

582
00:36:14,520 --> 00:36:15,580
Did it go smoothly?

583
00:36:17,080 --> 00:36:17,940
Minister Zhou.

584
00:36:19,210 --> 00:36:20,920
I suspect Inspector Su Men

585
00:36:22,210 --> 00:36:24,140
of colluding with the Communists.

586
00:36:25,690 --> 00:36:27,550
I will definitely find evidence.

587
00:36:28,660 --> 00:36:29,220
Yes.

588
00:36:31,250 --> 00:36:31,890
Go.

589
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:33,840
Find evidence immediately.

590
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:35,280
You must find that car.

591
00:36:35,520 --> 00:36:36,600
It's your duty

592
00:36:37,180 --> 00:36:38,310
to see this through.

593
00:36:38,690 --> 00:36:39,420
Understood.

594
00:36:56,850 --> 00:36:57,910
Where is Shen Kexi?

595
00:37:01,330 --> 00:37:01,890
Where?

596
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:11,600
It really was you guys who saved her?

597
00:37:12,040 --> 00:37:13,250
Ow, ow, ow!

598
00:37:15,120 --> 00:37:15,890
Let him go.

599
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:37,330
It's almost done. Get the medicine ready.

600
00:37:55,520 --> 00:37:57,320
Where did you get this medicine?

601
00:37:57,730 --> 00:37:59,990
Penicillin is more expensive than gold.

602
00:38:00,330 --> 00:38:01,930
Gold isn't as useful as this.

603
00:38:06,120 --> 00:38:07,250
Why did you save her?

604
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:11,410
I do whatever the Battalion Commander
tells me to do.

605
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:18,480
Go, cut her sleeve off.

606
00:38:28,040 --> 00:38:29,000
Slowly, slowly.

607
00:38:38,210 --> 00:38:39,340
You can go out first.

608
00:38:48,920 --> 00:38:49,920
Cover her up a bit.

609
00:38:54,600 --> 00:38:55,400
Help me.

610
00:39:26,380 --> 00:39:27,110
Hold it down.

611
00:39:33,440 --> 00:39:35,250
Her life is saved.

612
00:40:11,490 --> 00:40:12,970
What exactly do you do?

613
00:40:14,050 --> 00:40:16,110
You even know how to perform surgery?

614
00:40:17,370 --> 00:40:18,930
Do you know what she does?

615
00:40:21,890 --> 00:40:22,820
She's my cousin.

616
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:25,480
What's her identity?

617
00:40:27,090 --> 00:40:29,150
A volunteer for the Ciji Foundation.

618
00:40:29,160 --> 00:40:30,290
Is that all you know?

619
00:40:34,240 --> 00:40:35,320
Let me tell you.

620
00:40:37,180 --> 00:40:38,470
She is our comrade.

621
00:40:41,160 --> 00:40:41,970
Comrade?

622
00:40:47,990 --> 00:40:49,830
You're both Communists?

623
00:40:52,180 --> 00:40:53,380
Don't we look like it?

624
00:40:54,950 --> 00:40:56,140
I just didn't expect

625
00:40:56,670 --> 00:40:58,470
that a Nationalist battalion commander
like you

626
00:40:58,470 --> 00:40:59,930
would also be a Communist.

627
00:41:01,830 --> 00:41:03,670
What's wrong with being a Communist?

628
00:41:03,670 --> 00:41:04,830
I know better than you

629
00:41:04,830 --> 00:41:07,180
how Nanjing was lost by Tang Shengzhi.

630
00:41:08,910 --> 00:41:10,840
So you joined the Communist Party?

631
00:41:14,970 --> 00:41:16,520
Then what makes you think

632
00:41:16,730 --> 00:41:18,450
my cousin is also a Communist?

633
00:41:21,030 --> 00:41:23,300
No one could endure such torture.

634
00:41:28,610 --> 00:41:30,290
She's out of danger now.

635
00:41:39,660 --> 00:41:40,460
What's wrong?

636
00:41:41,140 --> 00:41:43,140
Thank you, Battalion Commander Du.

637
00:41:43,170 --> 00:41:45,020
No, Brother Du.

638
00:41:52,470 --> 00:41:53,620
Call me Master.

639
00:42:02,180 --> 00:42:04,510
There's another thing I don't understand.

640
00:42:04,510 --> 00:42:05,300
What is it?

641
00:42:05,780 --> 00:42:06,950
How did you know

642
00:42:07,170 --> 00:42:08,830
she would be at that hospital?

643
00:42:11,760 --> 00:42:14,110
Do you have people in No. 76 too?

644
00:42:36,220 --> 00:42:38,080
Do you think it was a coincidence?

645
00:42:40,290 --> 00:42:41,040
Impossible.

646
00:42:45,430 --> 00:42:48,490
There are so many people in Shanghai
who want to harm me,

647
00:42:48,900 --> 00:42:50,900
but the only one who could pull it off

648
00:42:51,520 --> 00:42:52,290
is him.

649
00:42:56,260 --> 00:42:57,320
No matter who it is,

650
00:42:57,520 --> 00:42:59,000
they're not worth another drink.
